#: index.php:317
msgid ""
"Rufus is a utility that helps format and create bootable USB flash drives, "
"such as USB keys/pendrives, memory sticks, etc."
msgstr ""
"Rufus — bu USB fleşkalar va xotira kartalarini formatlaş hamda ularni "
"yuklanuvçi  diskka aylantiriş uçun möljallangan qulay dasturdir."

#: index.php:318
msgid "It can be especially useful for cases where:"
msgstr "Rufus quyidagi holatlarda juda qöl keladi:"

#: index.php:320
msgid ""
"you need to create USB installation media from bootable ISOs (Windows, "
"Linux, UEFI, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"Yuklanuvçi ISO tasvirlaridan (Windows, Linux, UEFI va h.k.) örnatuvçi USB "
"taşuvçilar yaratiş kerak bölganda"

#: index.php:321
msgid "you need to work on a system that doesn't have an OS installed"
msgstr "Operatsion tizim örnatilmagan kompyuterda işlaşingiz kerak bölganda"

#: index.php:322
msgid "you need to flash a BIOS or other firmware from DOS"
msgstr ""
"DOS muhiti orqali BIOS yoki boşqa mikrodasturni yangilaş kerak bölganda"

#: index.php:323
msgid "you want to run a low-level utility"
msgstr "Quyi darajali (low-level) tizim utilitalasini işlatmoqçi bölsangiz"

#: index.php:325
msgid "Despite its small size, Rufus provides everything you need!"
msgstr ""
"Hajmi kiçik bölişiga qaramay, Rufus sizga kerakli barça imkoniyatlarni "
"taqdim etadi!"

#: index.php:326
msgid ""
"A non exhaustive list of Rufus supported ISOs is also provided at the bottom "
"of this page."
msgstr ""
"Uşbu sahifaning pastki qismida Rufus qöllab-quvvatlaydigan ISO "
"tasvirlarining (barçasi bölmasa-da) asosiy röyxati keltirilgan."

