#: index.php:382
msgid "System Requirements:"
msgstr "Tizim talablari:"

#: index.php:383
msgid "Windows 8 or later."
msgstr "Windows 8 yoki undan yangiroq versiyalar."

#: index.php:383
msgid "Once downloaded, the application is ready to use."
msgstr "Dastur yuklab olingaç, uni darhol işlatişingiz mumkin."

#: index.php:384
msgid "Supported Languages:"
msgstr "Qöllab-quvvatlanadigan tillar:"

#: index.php:430
msgid ""
"I will take this opportunity to express my gratitude to the translators who "
"made it possible for Rufus, as well as this webpage, to be translated in "
"various languages. If you find that you can use Rufus in your own language, "
"you should really thank them!"
msgstr ""
"Fursatdan foydalanib, Rufus va uşbu veb-sahifaning turli tillarga tarjima "
"qilinişiga munosib hissa qöşgan barça tarjimonlarga öz minnatdorçiligimni "
"bildiraman. Agar Rufusʼdan öz ona tilingizda foydalanayotgan bölsangiz, bu "
"birinçi navbatda ularning xizmatidir!"

#: index.php:434
msgid ""
"Download the executable and run it &ndash; no installation is necessary."
msgstr ""
"Faylni yuklab oling va işga tuşiring — dasturni örnatiş talab etilmaydi."

#: index.php:435
msgid "The executable is digitally signed and the signature should state:"
msgstr ""
"Dasturning bajariladigan fayli (executable) raqamli imzolangan bölib, imzoda "
"quyidagilar körsatilgan:"

#: index.php:437
msgid "(v1.3.0 or later)"
msgstr "(v1.3.0 yoki undan keyingi)"

#: index.php:438
msgid "(v1.2.0 or earlier)"
msgstr "(v1.2.0 yoki undan oldingi)"

#: index.php:440
msgid "Notes on DOS support:"
msgstr "DOS qöllab-quvvatlanişi böyiça izohlar:"

#: index.php:441
msgid ""
"If you create a DOS bootable drive and use a non-US keyboard, Rufus will "
"attempt to select a keyboard layout according to the locale of your system."
msgstr ""
"Agar siz DOS yuklanuvçi disk yaratsangiz va inglizça (AQŞ) bölmagan "
"klaviaturadan foydalansangiz, Rufus tizimingiz lokaliga qarab klaviaturani "
"tanlaşga urinib köradi."

#: index.php:442
msgid "Notes on ISO Support:"
msgstr "ISO qöllab-quvvatlanişi böyiça izohlar:"

#: index.php:443
#, php-format
msgid ""
"All versions of Rufus since v1.1.0 allow the creation of a bootable USB from "
"an <a target=\"_blank\" %s>ISO image</a> (.iso)."
msgstr ""
"Rufusʼning v1.1.0 versiyasidan boşlab barça versiyalari <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>ISO tasvirlardan</a> (.iso) yuklanuvçi  USB-disk yaratiş imkonini beradi."

#: index.php:444
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Creating an ISO image from a physical disc or from a set of files is very "
"easy to do however, through the use of a CD burning application, such as the "
"freely available <a target=\"_blank\" %s>InfraRecorder</a> or <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>CDBurnerXP</a>."
msgstr ""
"Jismoniy diskdan yoki bir neçta fayllardan ISO tasvirini yaratiş judayam "
"oson. Buning uçun mutlaqo bepul taqdim etiladigan <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>InfraRecorder</a> yoki <a target=\"_blank\" %s>CDBurnerXP</a> kabi CD "
"yoziş dasturlaridan foydalanişingiz mumkin."

#: index.php:447
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)"
msgstr "Tez-tez söraladigan savollar (FAQ)"

#. You are encouraged to add the translation for " (in English)." after "HERE</a></b>" as the FAQ is only available in English
#: index.php:448
#, php-format
msgid "A Rufus FAQ is available <b><a target=\"_blank\" %s>HERE</a></b>."
msgstr ""
"Rufus haqida köp beriladigan savollar bilan <b><a target=\"_blank\" %s>BU "
"YERDA</a></b> tanişişingiz mumkin."

#: index.php:449
#, php-format
msgid ""
"To provide feedback, report a bug or request an enhancement, please use the "
"GitHub <a target=\"_blank\" %s>issue tracker</a>. Or you can <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>send an e-mail</a>."
msgstr ""
"Fikr bildiriş, xatoliklar haqida xabar beriş yoki yangi funksiya taklif "
"qiliş uçun GitHubʼdagi <a target=\"_blank\" %s>muammolarni kuzatiş "
"tizimidan</a> foydalaning. Şuningdek, <a target=\"_blank\" %s>elektron poçta "
"yuborişingiz</a> ham mumkin."

#: index.php:452
msgid "License"
msgstr "Litsenziya"

#: index.php:453
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>GNU General Public License (GPL) version 3</a> or "
"later."
msgstr ""
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>GNU General Public License (GPL) 3-versiyasi</a> "
"yoki undan keyingi."

#: index.php:453
msgid ""
"You are free to distribute, modify or even sell the software, insofar as you "
"respect the GPLv3 license."
msgstr ""
"GPLv3 litsenziyasiga rioya qilgan holda, dasturiy taʼminotni tarqatişingiz, "
"özgartirişingiz yoki hatto sotişingiz ham mumkin."

#: index.php:454
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Rufus is produced in a 100%% transparent manner, from its <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>public source</a>, using a <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>MinGW32</a> environment."
msgstr ""
"Rufus barça uçun <a target=\"_blank\" %s>oçiq manbali kod</a> va <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>MinGW32</a> muhitidan foydalangan holda töliq (100%%) "
"şaffof tarzda işlab çiqiladi."

#. You are encouraged to append the translation for "(in English)" after "Changelog" as it is only available in English
#: index.php:457
msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "Özgarişlar röyxati"

#: index.php:497
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can clone the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>git</a> repository "
"using:"
msgstr ""
"Şuningdek, quyidagi buyruq orqali <a target=\"_blank\" %s>git</a> "
"repozitoriysini klonlab olişingiz mumkin:"

#: index.php:499
#, php-format
msgid ""
"For more information, see the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>GitHub project</a>."
msgstr ""
"Qöşimça maʼlumot uçun <a target=\"_blank\" %s>GitHubʼdagi loyiha</a> "
"sahifasiga qarang."

#: index.php:500
msgid ""
"If you are a developer, you are very much encouraged to tinker with Rufus "
"and submit patches."
msgstr ""
"Agar dasturçi bölsangiz, Rufus bilan tajriba qilib körişingiz va tuzatişlar "
"yuborişingizni mamnuniyat bilan kutib qilamiz."

#: index.php:503
msgid "Donations"
msgstr "Donat"

#: index.php:504
msgid ""
"Since I'm getting asked about this on regular basis, there is <b>no</b> "
"donation button on this page."
msgstr ""
"Bu haqida menga tez-tez savol berişgani uçun aytib ötay: bu sahifada heç "
"qanday donat qiliş tugmasi <b>yöq</b>."

#: index.php:505
msgid ""
"The main reason is that I feel that the donation system doesn't actually "
"help software development and worse, can be guilt-inducing for users who "
"choose not to donate."
msgstr ""
"Asosiy sababi şundaki, donat qiliş tizimi dastur rivojlanişiga amalda yordam "
"bermaydi deb hisoblayman. Qolaversa, bu donat qilmaslikni afzal körgan "
"foydalanuvçilarda noqulaylik yoki xijolatçilik tuğdirişi mumkin."

#: index.php:508
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If you really insist, you can always make a donation to the <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>Free Software Foundation</a>, as they are the main "
"reason software like Rufus is possible."
msgstr ""
"Agar xohlasangiz, <a target=\"_blank\" %s>Free Software Foundation</a> "
"fondiga donat qilişingiz mumkin — axir Rufus kabi dasturlarning mavjudligi "
"aynan ularning xizmatidir."

#: index.php:509
msgid ""
"At any rate, I'll take this opportunity to say <i><u>thank you</u></i> for "
"your continuing support and enthusiasm about this little program: it is much "
"appreciated!"
msgstr ""
"Nima bölganda ham, fursatdan foydalanib, uşbu kiçik dasturga körsatayotgan "
"töxtovsiz qöllab-quvvatlovingiz va qiziqişingiz uçun taşakkur izhor etaman — "
"bu men uçun juda qadrli!"

#: index.php:510
msgid ""
"But please continue to feel free to use Rufus without any guilt about not "
"contributing for it financially &ndash; you should never have to!"
msgstr ""
"Lekin xijolat bölmay, Rufus’dan bemalol foydalanavering — moddiy yordam "
"bermaganingiz uçun mutlaqo taşvişlanmang, çunki bu haq tölanadigan dastur "
"emas!"

#: index.php:513
msgid "Non exhaustive list of ISOs Rufus is known to work with"
msgstr ""
"Rufus aniq işlay oladigan ISO tasvirlarining (barçasi bölmasa-da) asosiy "
"röyxati:"

